{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Production tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG Maker MV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Play time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Game introduction text</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of the Three Temple Knights, dispatched on a secret mission, and takes place in late 19th century Europe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, Sir Virginio accepted a request from a certain lady.  But what truly awaits him...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.List the features of this game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short JRPG about vampires. 3 modes of difficulty! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy mode / Normal mode / Hard mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can be completed in 1-2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Great story, told from the perspective of Sir Virgino</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Impressive characters, with familiar faces from the Vampire Blaze series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Unique skills and tactics for key characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Translated with help from native English speaker, and not machine translation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is set in a serious tone, and is related to the Temple Knight and their mission to hunt vampires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2602910?t=1767835188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2602910?t=1767835188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767835188","capsule_imagev5":"https://s